    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/c0c6c1bf0bd9c3a3e3ea140f8de10a06.avif?t=1752917991\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Civilization has fallen.</strong> Join the Horde, launch yourself to the Zone and die purging the Hellspawn invasion in the humanity's last stand while competing for the highest scored <strong>Hellruns</strong> on the official leaderboards with other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/c0afa9f39dc1e2b63692d3254ff39131.poster.avif?t=1752917991\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/c0afa9f39dc1e2b63692d3254ff39131.webm?t=1752917991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/c0afa9f39dc1e2b63692d3254ff39131.mp4?t=1752917991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose violence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hordes signature <i>Ultraviolent gameplay</i> combined with 2.5D physics will put a smile even on the most conservative face. Shoot, slice, burn, electrocute, blow-up and pulverize hundreds of enemies at the same time. Combining kills also adds score multiplier (and makes you look like a pro).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Jump in anytime!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each <i>Hellrun</i> is divided to different Zones, that need to be purged from the Hellspawn to advance into the next one. Typical <i>Hellrun</i> only takes a few minutes. Perfect time killer for a coffee break or when <u>skipping work</u>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/e9ddbb702f5629c7c1787e6abee7a25a.poster.avif?t=1752917991\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/e9ddbb702f5629c7c1787e6abee7a25a.webm?t=1752917991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/e9ddbb702f5629c7c1787e6abee7a25a.mp4?t=1752917991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Competitive multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anti-social, single played multiplayer experience! Challenge other players directly in <strong><i>THE RETRIBUTION</i></strong> mode and beat their <i>Hellrun </i>scores asynchronously. Online leaderboards and punishing daily challenges included as well!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlimited replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Permadeath, seed based procedurally generated gameplay, dynamic weather, incredible realistic violence modeling and 2.5D physics combined with huge variety of weapons, enemies, power-ups, maps, secrets and bosses will give bang for your buck while keeping you busy!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Boomer shooter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just like in the good ol' days! Think Doom, Alien Breed, Hotline Miami and Tetris had a baby on steroids.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kick-ass soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We guarantee: The combination of acid house, techno and game tunes from the 80's and the 90's will make the killing as easy as breathing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/d71c5ef8f9907c7f014ded2ea0a4c862.poster.avif?t=1752917991\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/d71c5ef8f9907c7f014ded2ea0a4c862.webm?t=1752917991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/d71c5ef8f9907c7f014ded2ea0a4c862.mp4?t=1752917991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skill-based gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember the times when video games whooped everyone's asses? Those days are back: Stand your ground and fight!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NO early access, NO bulls*it!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy the ticket, take the ride. Horde will be fully released in 2025.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/c0c6c1bf0bd9c3a3e3ea140f8de10a06.avif?t=1752917991\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Civilization has fallen.</strong> Join the Horde, launch yourself to the Zone and die purging the Hellspawn invasion in the humanity's last stand while competing for the highest scored <strong>Hellruns</strong> on the official leaderboards with other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/c0afa9f39dc1e2b63692d3254ff39131.poster.avif?t=1752917991\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/c0afa9f39dc1e2b63692d3254ff39131.webm?t=1752917991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/c0afa9f39dc1e2b63692d3254ff39131.mp4?t=1752917991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose violence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hordes signature <i>Ultraviolent gameplay</i> combined with 2.5D physics will put a smile even on the most conservative face. Shoot, slice, burn, electrocute, blow-up and pulverize hundreds of enemies at the same time. Combining kills also adds score multiplier (and makes you look like a pro).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Jump in anytime!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each <i>Hellrun</i> is divided to different Zones, that need to be purged from the Hellspawn to advance into the next one. Typical <i>Hellrun</i> only takes a few minutes. Perfect time killer for a coffee break or when <u>skipping work</u>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/e9ddbb702f5629c7c1787e6abee7a25a.poster.avif?t=1752917991\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/e9ddbb702f5629c7c1787e6abee7a25a.webm?t=1752917991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/e9ddbb702f5629c7c1787e6abee7a25a.mp4?t=1752917991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Competitive multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anti-social, single played multiplayer experience! Challenge other players directly in <strong><i>THE RETRIBUTION</i></strong> mode and beat their <i>Hellrun </i>scores asynchronously. Online leaderboards and punishing daily challenges included as well!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlimited replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Permadeath, seed based procedurally generated gameplay, dynamic weather, incredible realistic violence modeling and 2.5D physics combined with huge variety of weapons, enemies, power-ups, maps, secrets and bosses will give bang for your buck while keeping you busy!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Boomer shooter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just like in the good ol' days! Think Doom, Alien Breed, Hotline Miami and Tetris had a baby on steroids.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kick-ass soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We guarantee: The combination of acid house, techno and game tunes from the 80's and the 90's will make the killing as easy as breathing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/d71c5ef8f9907c7f014ded2ea0a4c862.poster.avif?t=1752917991\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/d71c5ef8f9907c7f014ded2ea0a4c862.webm?t=1752917991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/d71c5ef8f9907c7f014ded2ea0a4c862.mp4?t=1752917991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skill-based gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember the times when video games whooped everyone's asses? Those days are back: Stand your ground and fight!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NO early access, NO bulls*it!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy the ticket, take the ride. Horde will be fully released in 2025.</p></li></ul>",
